      "cooked": "<p>Hi, after the VotM update the app sometimes crashes if my account is loaded.&nbsp;</p><p>Some seconds after the app was started and my name is displayed(with the game center symbol), the app crashes from time to time if I select anything. If I wait 5-10 seconds there is no problem.</p><p>Does anybody knows where I can find some logs on my iPad Air 2? I would send them to John if I have time and if it happens again. I use the newest iOS by the way.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
